 ## Delivery
 
-`estimateDelivery(orderedAt, transitDays)` returns the expected delivery date in Istanbul time.
+`estimateDelivery(orderedAt, transitDays)` returns the expected delivery date in Istanbul time (UTC+3), as `YYYY-MM-DD`.
+
+- Orders placed before 15:00 Istanbul time on a business day ship the same day.
+- Orders placed at or after 15:00, or on a Saturday or Sunday, ship on the next business day.
+- Delivery is `transitDays` business days (Monday to Friday) after the ship date.
+
+The result does not depend on the server's time zone. Pass `orderedAt` as a `Date` or as a timestamp with an offset, such as `2026-09-18T18:00:00+03:00` or `2026-09-18T15:00:00Z`. JavaScript reads a timestamp without an offset in the server's local time.
diff --git a/src/delivery.js b/src/delivery.js
